The '''Path of Het''' in [[Tombs of Amascut]] leads to [[Het's Seal|Het's seal]] and [[Akkha]], the guardian of [[Het]]. If another path has been entered, the helmet is removed to show that another path is currently being attempted. After the Path of Het is cleared, the fire disappears. 

